      "message": "I agree that the situation is tricky.\nYou are right, adding the ACTIVE_LOW flags should be done at once per pin. I prepared a separate CL for that.\nOf course, switching to the Zephyr GPIO API will be tricky, but these changes are actually a step in this process.",
      "parentUuid": "e50f2f1b_e163bb63",
      "revId": "52a5aad42237416f7132f9474b9b0d0a220401d9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
